    "message": "Restore candidate worlds from to_dict() without copying it again\n\nEffects and handlers that apply a change atomically build a candidate\nworld with from_dict(deepcopy(world.to_dict())). to_dict() already\nreturns a new document parsed from JSON, so the deepcopy only copied it\nagain (about 1 s for a 1440-minute world). The model code in domain/ is\nleft unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
